        "value": "To provide a systematic overview of the current understanding of intratumoral microbiota, addressing how these microbes originate, colonize, and functionally interact with tumor cells and the immune system to influence cancer progression and treatment outcomes, while highlighting methodological challenges and future translational directions.",
