        "value": "As a narrative review, this paper does not employ a systematic search protocol described in the text. Instead, it synthesizes findings from a broad range of sources including: 1) Historical timeline analysis of key advancements; 2) Summary of clinical trial data (Tables 1-5) linking specific microbial taxa to ICI/ACT outcomes; 3) Mechanistic discussion based on preclinical models (mouse studies) and human cohort analyses regarding immune cell activation, metabolite pathways (SCFAs, bile acids, etc.), and intratumoral interactions; 4) Evaluation of intervention strategies (antibiotics, FMT, probiotics, diet, engineered microbes) by summarizing results from ongoing and completed clinical trials.",
